        ('/**\n     * Get all keys using iterable. Keys traversing with SCAN operation.\n     *\n     * @param options scan options\n     * @return Iterable object\n     */', '/**\n     * 通过 SCAN 迭代获取所有键（异步 Iterable）。\n     *\n     * @param options SCAN 选项\n     * @return Iterable\n     */'),
