        ('/**\n     * Delete all keys of all existing databases\n     * in background without blocking server.\n     * <p>\n     * Requires Redis 4.0+\n     *\n     * @return void\n     */', '/**\n     * 清空所有数据库的所有键。\n     * 在后台执行，不阻塞服务器。\n     * <p>\n     * 需要 Redis 4.0+\n     *\n     * @return 无返回值\n     */'),
